@server="http://localhost:4004/"
@serverpath="/odata/v4/company-records"

### READ Metadata
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/company-records/$metadata

### Read Comapaines Records
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/company-records/Companies

### Read Address
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/company-records/Addresses

### CREATE/POST Addresses
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/company-records/Addresses
Content-Type:  application/json

{
    "street": "street-12273458",
    "city": "city-12273458",
    "state": "state-12273452",
    "postalCode": "postalCode-12273452",
    "country": "country-12273452"
}

##### DELETE Addresses
 DELETE http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/company-records/Addresses/41fe5d62-3f4a-435c-8068-3883e95f96be


### Select specific fields only
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/company-records/Companies?$select=industry

